{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "4cd23282-cc68-52da-8db2-89efbfb6431c",
    "name": "MercadoYa API",
    "description": "API de MercadoYa (v1). Levantar el sistema con `docker compose up -d --build` e importar también el entorno `MercadoYa.local.postman_environment.json`.\n\nCorrer las carpetas en orden (0 a 5): cada request guarda en variables los ids que usan los siguientes (`productId`, `categoryId`, `orderId`, `newProductId`). Las carpetas 3 y 4 piden un token: pestaña Authorization de la carpeta → *Get New Access Token* e iniciar sesión con el usuario que indica la carpeta.\n\nCada request trae tests que validan el código HTTP esperado.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "noauth"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. Salud",
      "description": "Health checks (sin token). `ready` revisa la base; RabbitMQ no cuenta para estar listo.",
      "auth": {
        "type": "noauth"
      },
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Vivo (live)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Responde 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/health/live",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "health",
                "live"
              ]
            },
            "description": "El proceso responde."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Listo (ready)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Responde 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test(\"Estado Healthy\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().status).to.eql(\"Healthy\"));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/health/ready",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "health",
                "ready"
              ]
            },
            "description": "La API puede atender: la base responde."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "1. Catálogo público",
      "description": "Lecturas sin sesión. Pasan por la caché del catálogo: el header `X-Cache` dice HIT o MISS.",
      "auth": {
        "type": "noauth"
      },
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Listar productos",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Responde 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const r = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test(\"Trae productos\", () => pm.expect(r.items.length).to.be.above(0));",
                  "pm.test(\"Tiene X-Cache\", () => pm.expect([\"HIT\", \"MISS\"]).to.include(pm.response.headers.get(\"X-Cache\")));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"productId\", r.items[0].id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products?page=1&pageSize=12",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "products"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "page",
                  "value": "1"
                },
                {
                  "key": "pageSize",
                  "value": "12"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Primera página del catálogo (solo productos activos)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Buscar sin tildes (\"cafe\")",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Responde 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test(\"Encuentra el café\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().items.map(p => p.name).join()).to.match(/caf[eé]/i));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products?search=cafe",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "products"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "search",
                  "value": "cafe"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "La búsqueda ignora mayúsculas y tildes: \"cafe\" encuentra \"Café molido 250 g\"."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Página 2",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Responde 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products?page=2&pageSize=12",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "products"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "page",
                  "value": "2"
                },
                {
                  "key": "pageSize",
                  "value": "12"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Paginación."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Detalle de producto",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Responde 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test(\"Tiene precio y stock\", () => { const p = pm.response.json(); pm.expect(p).to.have.property(\"priceCents\"); pm.expect(p).to.have.property(\"stock\"); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/{{productId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "products",
                "{{productId}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Usa el `productId` que guardó \"Listar productos\"."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Producto inexistente",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Responde 404\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(404));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/999999",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "products",
                "999999"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Un id que no existe (o un producto dado de baja) responde 404."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Búsqueda demasiado larga",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Responde 400\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(400));",
                  "pm.test(\"Error en search\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().errors).to.have.property(\"search\"));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products?search=aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "products"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "search",
                  "value": "aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Más de 100 caracteres: 400 con el error en el campo `search` (ValidationProblem)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Categorías",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Responde 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"categoryId\", pm.response.json()[0].id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/categories",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "categories"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Lista plana con `parentId` (126 categorías del seed)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Versión inexistente de la API",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Responde 404\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(404));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v2/products",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v2",
                "products"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Solo existe la v1: otra versión responde 404 con ProblemDetails."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Sin sesión (401)",
      "description": "Lo protegido sin token o con un token inválido responde 401.",
      "auth": {
        "type": "noauth"
      },
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Comprar sin token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Responde 401\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(401));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Idempotency-Key",
                "value": "{{$guid}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "orders"
              ]
            },
            "description": "El checkout exige sesión.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"productId\": {{productId}},\n      \"quantity\": 1\n    }\n  ]\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Admin sin token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Responde 401\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(401));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/products",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "admin",
                "products"
              ]
            },
            "description": "El panel exige sesión."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Token inválido",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Responde 401\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(401));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer esto.no.es-un-token"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/products",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "admin",
                "products"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Un token que no firmó Keycloak se rechaza aunque diga ser admin."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Cliente",
      "description": "Login como **cliente** (`cliente@mercadoya.local` / `Cliente123!`): en la pestaña Authorization de esta carpeta, *Get New Access Token*.",
      "auth": {
        "type": "oauth2",
        "oauth2": [
          {
            "key": "tokenName",
            "value": "cliente",
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "key": "grant_type",
            "value": "authorization_code_with_pkce",
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "key": "authUrl",
            "value": "{{keycloakRealm}}/protocol/openid-connect/auth",
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "key": "accessTokenUrl",
            "value": "{{keycloakRealm}}/protocol/openid-connect/token",
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "key": "clientId",
            "value": "web",
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "key": "redirect_uri",
            "value": "{{webUrl}}/",
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "key": "useBrowser",
            "value": false,
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          {
            "key": "challengeAlgorithm",
            "value": "S256",
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "key": "scope",
            "value": "openid",
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "key": "client_authentication",
            "value": "body",
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "key": "addTokenTo",
            "value": "header",
            "type": "string"
          }
        ]
      },
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Crear pedido",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"idempotencyKey\", pm.variables.replaceIn(\"{{$guid}}\"));"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Responde 202\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(202));",
                  "const o = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test(\"Nace Pendiente\", () => pm.expect(o.status).to.eql(\"Pendiente\"));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"orderId\", o.id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Idempotency-Key",
                "value": "{{idempotencyKey}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-Correlation-Id",
                "value": "postman-{{idempotencyKey}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "orders"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Checkout asíncrono: responde 202 con el pedido Pendiente; el worker lo confirma o rechaza en unos segundos. La `Idempotency-Key` evita duplicar la compra si se repite el pedido. El `X-Correlation-Id` aparece en los logs de api, worker y payments.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"productId\": {{productId}},\n      \"quantity\": 1\n    }\n  ]\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Repetir el mismo pedido (idempotencia)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Responde 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test(\"Es el mismo pedido\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().id).to.eql(pm.collectionVariables.get(\"orderId\")));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Idempotency-Key",
                "value": "{{idempotencyKey}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "orders"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Misma `Idempotency-Key`: devuelve el mismo pedido (200) y no crea otro.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"productId\": {{productId}},\n      \"quantity\": 1\n    }\n  ]\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Ver mi pedido",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Responde 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test(\"Tiene estado\", () => pm.expect([\"Pendiente\", \"Confirmado\", \"Rechazado\"]).to.include(pm.response.json().status));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "orders",
                "{{orderId}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Estado actual (Pendiente, Confirmado o Rechazado con su motivo). Un pedido de otro usuario da 404."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Pedido vacío",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Responde 400\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(400));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Idempotency-Key",
                "value": "{{$guid}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "orders"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Sin productos: 400 con el motivo.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"items\": []\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "El cliente no entra al admin",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Responde 403\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(403));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/products",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "admin",
                "products"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Con sesión pero sin rol admin: 403."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
